      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Remesh a mesh with LATO.2\n\n1. Pick a mesh in **model_file**, or add one with **upload mesh** (the example uses `hydrant.glb` from the node's `example_workflows/assets`).\n2. Set **vertex_count** (200 to 5000) and run.\n\n**model_3d** goes to Preview 3D, **mesh** to Save 3D Model. The GLB is also saved to `output/lato2`.\n\nNot set up yet? Run `python install_lato2.py` in `custom_nodes/ComfyUI-LATO2` and restart ComfyUI."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# Remesh a mesh with LATO.2\n\n1. Pick a mesh in **model_file**, or add one with **upload mesh** (the example uses `hydrant.glb` from the node's `example_workflows/assets`).\n2. Set **vertex_count** (200 to 5000) and run.\n\n**model_3d** goes to Preview 3D, **mesh** to Save 3D Model. The GLB is also saved to `output/lato2`.\n\nNot set up yet? Run `python install_lato2.py` in `custom_nodes/ComfyUI-LATO2` and restart ComfyUI."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
